Short:        ixemul startup & stubs for Dice & SAS
Author:       blaz.zupan@uni-mb.si
Uploader:     blaz zupan uni-mb si
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This archive contains a new startup code for Dice and SAS for use with
ixemul.library (the Unix emulation library by Markus Wild). For more
information please read the README file provided in the archive.
